            <div xml:id="d83-a1">

                <pb facs="0164" n="[90]" sameAs="frus:frus1866p2/pg90"/>

                <head>[Translation.]</head>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Art. 1</hi><hi rendition="#italic">.</hi> The
                    exportation through the Bar of Oporto of all wines produced on the Portuguese
                    soil is hereby permitted.</p>
                <p>§ <hi rendition="#italic">Solus.</hi> All wines exported through the Oporto Bar
                    shall pay the duties established on the export of all other wines of the
                    kingdom.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Art</hi>. 2. The government will publish the
                    necessary regulations for carrying into effect the present law.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Art.</hi> 3. The decrees of October 11, 1852, and all
                    other legislation in opposition to the dispositions of the present law, are
                    hereby revoked.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
